    ddx: ["Bronchiectasis Exacerbation", "COPD Exacerbation", "Pneumonia", "Pulmonary TB Reactivation", "Allergic Bronchopulmonary Aspergillosis"],
    goals: "Eradicate or suppress Pseudomonas, improve sputum clearance, reduce exacerbation frequency, preserve lung function",
    pharm: "1. Antibiotics based on previous sputum cultures: Oral Ciprofloxacin 750mg BID for 14 days (if Pseudomonas sensitive). 2. If resistant or severe exacerbation: consider IV antibiotics — Ceftazidime 2g Q8H or Meropenem 1g Q8H + Tobramycin (if needed). 3. Airway clearance: Nebulised hypertonic saline (7%) BID + chest physiotherapy TID. 4. Bronchodilator: Salbutamol neb 5mg before physiotherapy. 5. If haemoptysis significant: consider bronchial artery embolisation (BAE).",
